    "snippet": "- Thunderstorms will primarily favor higher terrain areas through early next week, with drier and less favorable conditions next week. The best thunderstorm chances will exist across the higher terrain areas through the beginning of next week with only slight chances for some isolated activity across the lower deserts.",
